:: Something in Cupboard Intro
The <<personsimple>> holds open the door allowing you to enter before closing the door behind you. <<He>> locks the door as <<he>> speaks, "Be careful, don't step on my cute babies." <<He>> guides you past what looks like a dozen kittens before leading you to the kitchen.
<br><br>
"As you saw in my post. Something keeps scratching the inside of my cupboard." The <<personsimple>> opens the door, making sure you can see the claw marks left against the wood. "If you do well, I might be willing to throw in a little extra. Just make sure not to let any harm come to my kittens."
<br><br>
The <<personsimple>> leaves you alone to survey the scene.
<br><br>
<<link [[Inspect the cupboard (0:10)|Something in Cupboard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Something in Cupboard
You inspect the inside of the cupboard but you see nothing of real interest. The scratches hold no real clues beyond the perpetrator being very small. This job may just be a matter of waiting for something to happen.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait a few hours (2:00)|Something in Cupboard Wait]]>><<pass 120>><</link>>

:: Something in Cupboard Wait
You sit and begin to wait for whatever has been clawing the inside of the cupboard. As you sit, the cats, curious of your presence, approach and lie next to you. <<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>
Eventually, you hear a small chittering near the cupboard. You put down the cat that has curled onto your lap and approach the cupboard.
<br><br>
Inside, you find a small mouse. It seems like a mouse has somehow been managing to climb up into the cupboard every so often. You scoop up the small critter and report to the home owner.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:05)|Something in Cupboard Success]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Something in Cupboard Success
"A mouse?" The employer looks curiously at the small white mouse held in your hands. "I never would have expected a mouse to show up here with so many cats around. What a brave little soldier. Here, hand him to me."
<br><br>
The <<person>> takes the mouse into <<his>> hands and gently wraps it in a handkerchief. "What a cute little bugger. I'll find him a nice home. Thanks a lot for your help, I'll make sure to leave you a good review. Thanks a lot!"
<br><br>
<<He>> smiles kindly as <<he>> hands you <<moneyGain $investigatorpayout>>. You give a wave as you return to the street.
<br><br>
