:: Something Following Intro
The <<personsimple>> lets you in with a nervous glance. "Did you see anybody out there? I mean anything watching my home? I know something is out there." <<He>> takes a nervous look outside before closing the door.
<br><br>
"Here's the deal. You follow me from afar and, if you see anybody, I want you to apprehend them okay?" The <<personsimple>> scratches <<his>> neck. <<if $transformationParts.traits.sharpEyes is "default" or $transformationParts.dragon.eyes isnot "disabled">>You notice some black veins around the <<personsimple>>'s neck.<</if>>
