:: Something Following
<<rng 50 100>>
You trail behind your employer as <<he>> walks. At first you begin to think it was just paranoia but... something is wrong. Half an hour into the walk, you can see a shape following the <<personsimple>> down the sidewalk.
<br><br>
<<if $world_corruption_soft gte $rng>>
    <<set $payoutmultiplier to 2>>
