:: Something Following Success
<<loadNPC 0 "Domus">><<person1>>
"Is this them?" The employer looks at the stalker now held tightly in your grip. "What a pathetic loser. Would you mind coming to the police station while I report this?"
<br><br>
The <<person>> guides you to the police station as you hold down the suspect. As you enter, the police take the stalker from your hands, careful to hold their bindings tight as they are thrown into a cell.
<br><br>
As you exit the station, the <<personsimple>> turns to you with a smile. <<He>> hands you <<moneyGain $investigatorpayout>> as <<he>> speaks, "Really, I have to say well done. I can sleep well now knowing that pervert is behind bars. I will make sure to tell my friends to message if they need help with anything."
<br><br>
