:: Cracked Wall Intro
The <<personsimple>> steps aside as you enter. As you follow, <<he>> begins to speak, "Sorry for the informality, my father has been quite busy with his business and can't spare time for small matters such as these. I hope you understand."
<br><br>
The two of you arrive in a dark room, large cracks stretch and branch up the wall. You peer through the cracks but can't see anything inside but brick. Seems the wall is pretty solid.
<br><br>
As you examine the room, the <<person>> clears <<his>> throat to grab your attention. "So as you can see, the wall has been rapidly deteriorating. We've had several contractors over to take a look, but they simply say it is due to poor foundations. We wish you luck."
<br><br>
As <<he>> speaks, he turns and leaves the room, leaving you to your job.
<br><br>
<<link [[Examine the cracks closer (0:20)|Cracked Wall]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

