:: Missing Children 3
As you watch from the ground, still staggering from the assault, the beast stands tall, towering over you. It lets out another thick chortle as it grabs the twitching basket and leaps through a hole in the ground emitting light.
<br><br>
Strange runes decorate the edge of the hole, but as the creature leaps in, the hole flares brighter and the earth begins to crumble, sealing the hole.
<br><br>
You sit alone in silence for a moment before being able to relax.
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Give up the request (2:00)|Missing Children Fail 2]]>><<pass 120>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Missing Children 4
The creature staggers back, breathing heavily. It looks between you and the basket before leaping into the hole in the ground where the light burns from.
<br><br>
Strange runes decorate the edge of the hole, but as the creature leaps in, the hole flares brighter and the earth begins to crumble, sealing the hole.
<br><br>
You stumble to your feet before walking over and lifting the lid off of the wicker basket. Inside, you find several small children trembling in fear.
<br><br>
You reach in and help the children climb out before leading them up and out of the den.
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Guide the children back to town (2:30)|Missing Children Success]]>><<pass 150>><<endevent>><</link>>

