:: Mysterious Death Intro
"Mysterious deaths?" The <<personsimple>> asks before glancing around. "Are you with the police? You look a little young but... Come in I suppose."
<br><br>
The <<person>> steps aside and lets you enter. As you enter, you are met with a gruesome scene. The inside of the mansion is a mess. Blood stains the ground and a body lies in the center of the room. Police officers gather around the body taking pictures and sampling the blood around the scene.
<br><br>
As you approach, they look at you with a glance of confusion before shrugging. They must have heard of your work around town and don't mind as long as you don't disturb the scene. You step closer and examine the body intently.
<br><br>
The state of the body is gruesome. Stitches line the stomach of the body and you can catch a glimpse of rock and straw inside the poorly stitched wound. You wonder what kind of person would do this to someone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mysterious Death]]>><<endevent>><<clearNPC "Danube">><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death
<<generate1>><<person1>>
<<saveNPC 0 "PIOfficer">>
As you examine the body, a younger officer approaches. <<He>> waits a moment before coughing and speaking up. "So uh... I've seen you around town often. You're that <<girl>> from the orphanage right? I've heard about your work investigating incidents in town."
<br><br>
The officer looks down, a glint of red on <<his>> face. "I'm actually a big fan of your work. You're actually going out there and making a difference. I wish I could do that. Police work is nothing like I dreamed of."
<br><br>
The <<person>> sighs, dusting <<his>> police cap and placing it back on <<his>> head. "I guess what I mean to say is let me help out this time! It will help having an officer who can assist with clearance right? Let me help."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept <<his>> help|Mysterious Death Accept]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Deny <<his>> help|Mysterious Death Deny]]>><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death Deny
The officer steps back in shock. "Are you serious? Why would you turn down my help? Is it because you're worried or because you think I can't handle it? Listen, I'm not taking no as an answer. As an officer, it is my duty to keep people safe and that includes you."
<br><br>
<<He>> steps forward and crosses <<his>> arms. "So I'm coming along anyway, understood?"
<br><br>
It seems there is no saying no to this <<personsimple>>.
<br><br>
<<link [[Reluctantly accept it|Mysterious Death Accept]]>><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death Accept
You sigh and agree to the officer's offer to help. <<He>> looks happy and slaps your back. "That's more like it. Now let me help you out here. From our work so far, it seems several people broke into the house in the dead of night and killed the resident. They were disemboweled and stuffed with straw and pebbles. It's quite gruesome, I wouldn't recommend inspecting the corpse up close."
<br><br>
The officer looks a bit queasy even describing the scene but composes <<himself>> and continues, "It looks like the suspects left and headed further east. What say we go check it out?" <<He>> flashes a sly grin and begins to walk. You do have to admit, having <<him>> around is proving useful.
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow the trail east (0:30)|Mysterious Death East]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death East
You follow behind the officer as <<he>> leads you across town to the east. The light glints off the badge on <<his>> black uniform. "You know, I've dreamed of this moment since I heard of you. Making a real difference and fighting crime together! This is gonna be great."
<br><br>
Finally, you arrive at the entrance to the moor. The officer glances around and searches for the trail. "Aha!" <<he>> exclaims as <<he>> gestures for you to come. Hidden in the grass you find footprints that end here.
<br><br>
"Listen," <<he>> puts <<his>> finger to <<his>> lips. "If the trail ends here, the person must be close. We gotta do a stakeout! If we wait around here, the perpetrator should show themself in time."
<br><br>
<<He>> sits down and pats the dirt next to <<him>>. You glance around before sitting in the tall grass. 
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour lt 20>><<set _passTime to "<<passTimeUntil 20>>">><<set _passTimeDisplay to "0:" + ("0" + ((45 - Time.minute + 60) % 60)).slice(-2)>><</if>>
<<link [[Wait for something to happen|Mysterious Death Wait]]>>_passTime<</link>>

:: Mysterious Death Wait
You spend some time talking with the officer. <<He>> tells you <<his>> name is Eirian and tells you a bit of <<his>> story. <<He>> mentions <<he>> came from a long line of officers but always hated the corruption that plagued the department, about wanting to make the world a truly better place, about making this town safe.
<br><br>
As <<he>> finishes, <<he>> turns to you before blushing and looking away embarrassed. "Sorry I guess I overshared. It's just not often I actually get to talk about this kind of business. Usually I'm just ordered around by the other officers and never get a break." <<He>> chuckles.
<br><br>
Suddenly, there is a rustle from nearby. <<He>> instantly falls silent and places a hand over your mouth before throwing the two of you to the ground. You look through the tall grass and see the shapes of several figures.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mysterious Death 2]]>><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death 2
At the head of a pack is a thin frail woman surrounded by large men in what look like beast costumes. Before you can even think, Eirian stands, flashing <<his>> badge.
<br><br>
"Halt in the name of the law, I am an officer under authority to arrest you for suspected murder. I recommend coming quietly." The surrounding area is quiet for a moment, before several other officers come from nearby.
<br><br>
You look down and see Eirian's hand clasping the radio. It seems <<he>> had been sending silent messages through the radio since the figures appeared. As the officers draw close, you can sense something is wrong.
<br><br>
The officers and yourself fall to the ground as the world begins to spin.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:30)|Mysterious Death 3]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>

:: Mysterious Death 3
<<earnFeat "Perchta">>
The world glows purple, then red. You see visions of the town swallowed in dark mist, men and women in beast costumes celebrate around a burning building. Your vision flashes the figures appearing and disappearing rapidly like a strobe light before you wake up. <<gggstress>><<stress 150>>
<br><br>
Your eyes jerk open as you fall back and breathe rapidly. You look around but nobody seems to be here... not the strange figures, nor the officers. Just what happened?
<br><br>
